# Dead Signal Studio — what never belongs in the repository.
#
# The installer writes real credentials and real user data INSIDE the folder,
# because the folder is the whole tool and has to stay copyable. That makes an
# accidental `git add .` the most expensive mistake available here, so the
# secrets are listed first and by exact path.

# ---- secrets and per-install configuration -------------------------------
# Written by setup.php. Holds the database password and the setup secret.
/server/env.php
# Written by setup.php. Per-install settings: quotas, storage path, enabled flag.
/server/config/
# Written by setup.php beside index.html. Names this install's API base.
/studio.config.json

# ---- user data -----------------------------------------------------------
# Uploaded assets, project blobs and the rate-limit buckets.
/server/data/

# ---- environments and editors --------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# ---- build and test scratch ----------------------------------------------
/test-output/
/coverage/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
playwright-report/
test-results/
